Rāma wails with uplifted arms for Vaidēhī --- Rāma fears father will see him dead of grief --- Lakṣmaṇa urges striving together without despair --- Lakṣmaṇa suggests Sītā hides to test them --- Brothers search woods hills rivers and lakes --- Rāma says dearer than life is nowhere seen --- Rāma faints bewildered with long hot sighs --- Lakṣmaṇa comforts Rāma with folded hands